Content:
Nɔmlɔ kpakpa kue fami
1Yawɛ, wo mi nguɔ,
ejakaa i peeɔ nɔ́ nɛ da;
i ngɔ ye hɛ kɛ fɔ o nɔ kulaa.
2Yawɛ, kaa mi nɛ o hyɛ;
hyɛ ye tsui mi, nɛ o hyɛ ye juɛmi mi.
3Ejakaa o suɔmi nɛ ngɛ daa a lɛ kpakaa mi;
o we anɔkuale ɔ lɛ tsɔɔ mi blɔ.
4I kɛ yakayaka nimli bɔɛ;
i kɛ osatotsɛmɛ pee we nɔ́ ko.
5I sume he nɛ yayami peeli bua a he nya ngɛ;
i kɛ yiwutsotsɛmɛ bɔɛ juami.
6Yawɛ, ma fɔ ye dɛ
kɛ tsɔɔ kaa yayami ko be ye he;
konɛ ma bɔle bɔ sami la tɛ ɔ.
7Ma la sina la, nɛ ma gba
nyakpɛ níhi tsuo nɛ o pee.
8Yawɛ, i suɔ o hi he ɔ.
I suɔ o we ɔ, he nɛ o hɛ mi nyami ɔ ngɛ ɔ.
9Ko kpata ye hɛ mi kɛ piɛ yayami peeli a he;
koo gbe mi kɛ piɛ muɔ si pueli a he.
10Daa be tsuaa be ɔ,
nimli nɛ ɔmɛ ngɛ yayami he ga toe;
a dɛ mi hyi tɔ kɛ nyɔ mi ní.
11Se imi lɛɛ nɔ́ nɛ da lɛ i peeɔ.
Naa mi mɔbɔ, nɛ o he ye yi wami.
12Ma je Yawɛ yi ngɛ ma a tsuo hɛ mi;
ejakaa i ye ye he kɛ je amanehluhi tsuo a mi.

Mawu ji matsɛ
1Yawɛ ngɛ matsɛ yee.
E mia kɛ agboje, kɛ he wami.
Ee, e ngɔ je ɔ ngɔ ma si kpɛii,
nɛ a be nyɛe ma je kɛ je e blɔ he.
2Yawɛ, o matsɛ sɛ ɔ ngɛ kɛ je blema lokoo;
mo nitsɛ hu o ngɛ kɛ je neneene.
3Yawɛ, wo ɔ ngɛ gbi woe;
ee, wo ɔ ngɛ pɛe;
oslɔke ɔmɛ ngɛ kue kɛ ngmlaa.
4Se Yawɛ nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ
he wa kulaa pe wo ɔ nɛ ngɛ pɛe ɔ;
Yawɛ he wa kulaa pe wo nɔ oslɔke ɔmɛ.
5Yawɛ, o mlaa amɛ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene;
klɔuklɔu peemi sa o we ɔ daa.

Yi jemi la
1Nyɛ je ɔ tsuo, nyɛ hwɔ lele ha Yawɛ!
2Nyɛ sɔmɔ Yawɛ kɛ bua jɔmi;
nyɛɛ ba e hɛ mi kɛ bua jɔmi lahi!
3Nyɛ na nyɛɛ le kaa Yawɛ ji Mawu.
Lɛ nɛ e bɔ wɔ;
e níhi ji wɔ.
E ma ji wɔ;
wa ngɛ kaa tohi nɛ e ngɛ lɛe.
4Nyɛɛ ngɔ sina ba ha lɛ ngɛ e we ɔ;
nyɛ je e yi ngɛ e kue ɔmɛ a mi.
Nyɛɛ na lɛ si, nɛ nyɛ je e yi.
5 Yawɛ hi;
e naa wɔ mɔbɔ daa,
nɛ e we anɔkuale ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene.

Sina la
1 Nyɛɛ na Yawɛ si;
ejakaa Yawɛ hi,
nɛ e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
2Nyɛɛ na mawu ɔmɛ a Mawu ɔ si;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
3Nyɛɛ na nyɔmtsɛmɛ a Nyɔmtsɛ ɔ si;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
4Lɛ nɔ kake too lɛ e peeɔ nyakpɛ ní;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
5 Lɛ nɛ e ngɔ nile kɛ pee hiɔwe kɛ zugba;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
6 Lɛ nɛ e ngɔ zugba a kɛ ha nyu ɔ hɛ mi;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
7 Lɛ nɛ e pee kane nguanguahi;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
8Lɛ nɛ e haa nɛ pu tsoɔ piani;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
9Lɛ nɛ e haa nyɔhiɔ, kɛ dodoehi kpɛɔ nyɔ mi;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
10 Lɛ nɛ e gbe Egipt bi ɔmɛ a kekleekle bimɛ;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
11 Nɛ e je Israel bi ɔmɛ kɛ je Egipt bi ɔmɛ a dɛ mi;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
12Lɛ nɛ e ngɔ e he wami kpetekpleenyɛ ɔ
kɛ tsu nɔ́ nɛ ɔ;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
13 Lɛ nɛ e gba Wo Tsu ɔ mi;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
14Nɛ e ha e ma, Israel nyɛɛ wo ɔ mi kɛ be;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
15Se Egipt matsɛ ɔ kɛ e ta a lɛɛ
e kpata a hɛ mi ngɛ Wo Tsu ɔ mi;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
16Lɛ nɛ e hɛɛ e ma a kɛ gu nga kplanaa a nɔ;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
17Nɛ e gbe matsɛmɛ nguanguahi;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
18Lɛ nɛ e gbe matsɛmɛ nɛ he biɛ nɛ ɔmɛ hulɔ,
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
19 Amor matsɛ, Sihon;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
20 Bashan matsɛ, Og;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
21Lɛ nɛ e ngɔ a zugba amɛ
kɛ ha e ma a kaa a weto ní;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
22Lɛ nɛ e ngɔ zugba amɛ
kɛ ha e tsɔlɔ, Israel kaa e weto ní;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
23Benɛ wa yi fi wawɛɛ ɔ,
lɛ nɛ e kai wɔ;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
24Lɛ nɛ e je wɔ kɛ je wa he nyɛli a dɛ mi;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
25Lɛ nɛ e haa nibɔ ní tsuo niye ní;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
26Nyɛɛ na Mawu nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ si;
ejakaa e suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ yaa neneene!
